{"speciesId":744,"names":{"fr":"Rocabot","es":"Rockruff","en":"Rockruff","ja":"イワンコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Comme il s’attache facilement à son Dresseur, on le conseille souvent aux débutants, bien qu’il ait tendance à devenir plus rebelle avec l’âge."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su carácter amigable lo convierte en el Pokémon ideal para Entrenadores novatos. Sin embargo, al crecer suele volverse un poco agresivo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It’s considered to be a good Pokémon for beginners because of its friendliness, but its disposition grows rougher as it grows up."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"よく なつくので 初心者に お勧めのポケモンと いわれるが 育つと 気性は 荒くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon vit depuis toujours avec les humains. Lorsque son Dresseur est triste, il reste à ses côtés pour le soutenir moralement."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Acostumbran a vivir con los humanos desde la antigüedad. Intuyen si su Entrenador está triste, en cuyo caso no se despegan de su lado."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon has lived with people since times long ago. It can sense when its Trainer is in the dumps and will stick close by its Trainer’s side."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"昔から 人と 暮らしてきた。 トレーナーが 悲しんでいると それを 察して 側を 離れない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il devient de plus en plus sauvage et agressif en grandissant. Il n’est pas rare que son Dresseur l’abandonne, ne sachant plus qu’en faire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A medida que crece, se vuelve más salvaje y agresivo. No son pocos los Entrenadores que se deshacen de él por no poder controlarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"育つに つれて 気性は 荒く 攻撃的に なる。 持て余して 捨てる トレーナーも 少なくない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il frotte les cailloux pointus de son cou contre son Dresseur en signe d’affection. C’est adorable, mais douloureux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Restriega las rocas que tiene en el cuello contra su Entrenador como señal de afecto, pero son tan puntiagudas que hacen bastante daño."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that’s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"首の 岩を こすりつけてくるのは 親愛の 証。 ただし 岩は 鋭いので かなり 痛いぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon s’attache vite à son Dresseur, mais a une fâcheuse tendance à le mordre, ce qui peut compliquer son entraînement."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se encariña con su Entrenador rápidamente, pero su tendencia a dar mordiscos hace que dedicarse a entrenarlo sea una ardua labor."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"よく 懐くが 噛み癖が あるので ずっと 育てるには なかなか 骨が 折れるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il intimide ses ennemis en cognant les rochers autour de son cou contre le sol. Au premier signe de faiblesse, il passe à l’assaut."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Intimida a los rivales golpeando contra el suelo las rocas que tiene en el cuello y, tan pronto como retroceden, se abalanza sobre ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon intimidates opponents by striking the ground with the rocks on its neck. The moment an opponent flinches, Rockruff attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"首の岩を 地面に 打ちつけ 相手を 威嚇。 怯んだ 瞬間に 襲いかかるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":744,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",4],[25,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"level-up",26],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",26],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",8],[25,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[17,"level-up",34],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",34],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",32],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",32],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scary-face","learns":[[17,"level-up",37],[18,"level-up",37],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",40],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mud-slap","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sandstorm","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"charm","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"na